{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56349","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 心如水兮二章（一章十句，一章八句）（心如水兮，志尚清洁矣。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 心如水兮二章（一章十句，一章八句）（心如水兮，志尚清洁矣。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我公之心，含渊濬洁。\n挹之弥冲，酌而莫竭。\n灵府汪洋，璇源莹彻。\n若监之明，如井之洌。\n利物至柔，漱芳弥潏。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}